 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's doable. What cities are on deck for the weekend? No rush. A quick search shows a basic lunch for four on a park bench costs what? Fair. A box of crackers, a few bananas, and a couple of sandwich rolls will cost under two dollars. You' welcome. A spot by a big tree in the park is nice on a hot day. Bring lots of bags and your gloves. You'll be surprised how fast it goes. A few sandwiches each for the following few days keeps the mood going.",
